First rauc install on hardware, 2026-10-29. Board running d6cfccb (the factory image, slot A),
bundle beaglebone_black-148947a.raucb fetched into /data over the static address, SHA-256
877ddcb7d10033610c3872b4cf01dd45d9bd3b4390cd1892b62b5cd333755a96 on the board, equal to the
host's. Console capture by the user; the bracketed prefix is the capturing terminal's clock.

